'@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
title 系统与外部交互用例
skinparam useCaseShape rectangle

actor "支付网关" as P
actor "系统" as S
actor "Mock充电机" as MC

usecase "支付回调" as CB
usecase "自动扣费结算" as AUTO
usecase "审计日志记录" as AUDIT
usecase "模拟充电启停" as MCS
usecase "查询充电状态" as QC_CM

P --> CB
S --> AUTO
S --> AUDIT
MC --> MCS
MC --> QC_CM
note top of MC : Swing 桌面客户端\n模拟物理充电机前后端交互

AUTO <.left. CB : <<include>>
@enduml